      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_01b",
      "hash64": "C09C951A1D62FD1C",
      "text": "Pas de chance. C’est le pire temps pour toi.\\nOn dirait que la montagne est de mon côté.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_02",
      "hash64": "9157825018C8E663",
      "text": "Tu sais... La Ligue vient plusieurs fois par an faire\\nce genre d’inspection dans les Arènes.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_03",
      "hash64": "9157815018C8E4B0",
      "text": "Et si on ne se montre pas suffisamment à\\nla hauteur, on perd notre place de Champion.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_04",
      "hash64": "9157885018C8F095",
      "text": "Bien sûr, Alisma dit que ce ne sont que\\ndes formalités...[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_05",
      "hash64": "9157875018C8EEE2",
      "text": "Mais déjà que j’ai dû faire une croix sur\\nmes rêves de snowboardeur...\\c\\nSi on m’enlève le seul autre truc pour lequel\\nje suis doué, il ne me restera plus rien ![VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 162,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_06",
      "hash64": "9157865018C8ED2F",
      "text": "Pardon, je ne voulais pas jeter un froid...\\nAlors qu’en vérité, tout ça, c’est très simple.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_07",
      "hash64": "9157855018C8EB7C",
      "text": "Il suffit que je te congèle jusqu’aux os,\\net tout ira bien.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_08",
      "hash64": "91578C5018C8F761",
      "text": "Alisma doit vraiment avoir une dent contre moi,\\npour m’envoyer quelqu’un d’aussi fort que toi.\\r\\nJe n’avais aucune chance.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_09",
      "hash64": "91578B5018C8F5AE",
      "text": "Mais je ne regrette rien. J’ai pu montrer tout\\nce que j’avais en moi.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_10",
      "hash64": "9153FE5018C5D040",
      "text": "J’ai tout donné et j’ai quand même perdu...\\nFranchement, c’est hyper frustrant.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_11",
      "hash64": "9153FF5018C5D1F3",
      "text": "Ça m’a donné envie de prendre mon rôle\\nde Champion d’Arène plus au sérieux.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_12",
      "hash64": "9154005018C5D3A6",
      "text": "Tu as rallumé une flamme en moi, alors qu’elle\\nétait complètement éteinte...\\r\\nMerci, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
